    "text": "*Kimin?* means whose: *Bu çanta kimin?* (Whose bag is this?) The answer is a genitive: *Benim.* (It's mine.) *Kimde?* asks who has it on them right now: *Anahtar kimde?* (Who has the key?) *Bende.* (I do.)",
